              "text": "inopīnātus, inopīnāta, inopīnātum — \"unexpected\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Inopīnātum perīculum nōs terruit. An unexpected danger frightened us."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "inopīnātus, inopīnāta, inopīnātum: in- not + the participle of opīnor: not supposed. Ex inopīnātō, unexpectedly."
            }
          ]
        },
